midi/pack Directory for the Midiname library
Chris Ahlstrom
2026-03-25 to 2026-03-25

The header files in this directory are named after defined MIDNAM
elements, but using all lowercase and no underscores [1].
Some header files define more than one (related) class:

    -   patchbank.hpp
        -   programchange
        -   patchmidicommands
        -   patch
        -   patchbank
        -   patchbanks

This file also notes elements (classes), laid out in the doc/dia diagrams,
which are not implemented. Standalone elements are too small to warrant
a separate module/class, and are often simply class members of a simple
type.

    -   Author
    -   Manufacturer
    -   Model
    -   SupportsStandardDeviceMode

[1] I once worked on an large assembly-language project where
    the symbols were long names, almost sentences, all UPPER CASE
    and no underscores. You get used to it.

